# Catch-all for every current and future per-script E2E scratch dir
# (e.g. .e2e-multi-backend-scratch/, .e2e-download-scratch/) -- these can
# hold real settings/credentials dumped during a run (configure-plugin.php
# captures/restores wpguard_nc_settings including app_password) and must
# never land in this public repo. The explicit entries above predate this
# and are kept for clarity but are now redundant with this pattern.
.e2e-*-scratch/
